!RECURRING: CELESTE VAUGHN (24) · CAMILLE RHODES (38) · SILAS MERRIWEATHER (57) · GLORIA BAKER (48) · DR. YVETTE CUMMINGS (51) · WINSTON FAIRLEY (62) · RUBY "NANA RUBY" TOLLIVER (66) · BRIELLE SUTTON (21) · BEATRIX "NANNY BEA" PENNINGTON (43) · THADDEUS CROWE (40)

