!— SIMONE presses an antique gold POCKET WATCH into MARC's palm: "This was his. He'd want it ticking."

!— CELESTE, in red, turns to see a woman arriving at the Crown Gate in a car. She's also in red.

!— At the guardhouse, ESTHER leans forward to look at the security monitor. On the screen, MARC is laughing. She sits back. ESTHER: "Turn the car around."

